OL,3,GNEWSATrain cancellations due to
OL,4,A'emergency incident'
OL,5,
OL,6,FTrain services between Stevenage and
OL,7,FLondon have been cancelled or delayed
OL,8,Fdue to an emergency incident.
OL,10,FGreat Northern Rail and Thameslink said
OL,11,Femergency services are dealing with a
OL,12,Fsituation in the Knebworth area which
OL,13,Fhas led to all lines between the
OL,14,Fstations being closed.
OL,16,FPassengers should expect trains to be
OL,17,Fcancelled, delayed by up to an hour, or
OL,18,Fdiverted via Hertford North, the rail
OL,19,Fcompanies said on their websites.
OL,23,APub: 19-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
